e="stroke-width: 0.5;" transform="matrix(1,0,0,1,0.5,0.5)"></g><g><text x="664" y="461" fill="#000000" style="font-size: 12px; text-anchor: start; font-family: Helvetica, Arial;"><tspan> </tspan></text></g><g stroke="#000000" style="stroke-width: 0.5;" transform="matrix(1,0,0,1,0.5,0.5)"></g><g><text x="664" y="391" fill="#000000" style="font-size: 12px; text-anchor: start; font-family: Helvetica, Arial;"><tspan> </tspan></text></g><g stroke="#000000" style="stroke-width: 0.5;" transform="matrix(1,0,0,1,0.5,0.5)"></g><g><text x="664" y="345" fill="#000000" style="font-size: 12px; text-anchor: start; font-family: Helvetica, Arial;"><tspan> </tspan></text></g><g><text x="843" y="175" fill="#000000" style="font-size: 12px; text-anchor: start; font-family: Helvetica, Arial;">CT</text><text x="843" y="193" fill="#000000" style="font-size: 12px; text-anchor: start; font-family: Helvetica, Arial;"></text></g><line x1="839" x2="839" y1="163" y2="760" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1,0,0,1,0.5,0.5)" style="stroke-width: 0.5;"></line><g stroke="#000000" style="stroke-width: 0.5;" transform="matrix(1,0,0,1,0.5,0.5)"><line x1="839" x2="899" y1="380" y2="380"></line></g><g><text x="869" y="391" fill="#000000" style="font-size: 12px; text-anchor: middle; font-family: Helvetica, Arial;"><tspan>CT12</tspan></text></g><g stroke="#000000" style="stroke-width: 0.5;" transform="matrix(1,0,0,1,0.5,0.5)"><line x1="455" x2="899" y1="760" y2="760"></line><line x1="455" x2="899" y1="204" y2="204"></line><line x1="899" x2="899" y1="169" y2="760"></line><line x1="455" x2="659" y1="760" y2="760"></line></g><g stroke="#000000" style="stroke-width: 2;"><line x1="497" x2="455" y1="772" y2="772"></line></g><text x="506" y="788" style="font-size: 18px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial;">flat / 0°</text><rect x="455" y="204" width="444" height="556" fill="#ff00ff" style="stroke-width: 0; fill-opacity: 0;"></rect></g><g></g><g></g><g></g><g></g></svg></div><!-- ngIf: editor --></div></div><!-- end ngRepeat: profile in profiles --><!-- ngRepeat: meteo in meteos --></main></div><script type="text/ng-template" id="main.html"><div console></div><div ng-if="!timelines.length &amp;&amp; !profiles.length &amp;&amp; !meteos.length"><div class="intro"><div class="intro-inner"><img width="100%" src="img/logo_large.svg"></div></div></div><main class="container-fluid"><div visualizer ng-repeat="timeline in timelines"></div><div pvisualizer ng-repeat="profile in profiles"></div><div class="fenestra" meteographer ng-repeat="meteo in meteos" meteo="meteo" lang="lang" on-close="destroy('meteos', $index)"></div></main></script><script type="text/ng-template" id="help.html"><div class="container help"><div ui-view></div><div class="modal" id="imagemodal" ng-click="closepopup();"><span class="close">&times;</span><img class="modal-content" id="img01"><div id="caption"></div></div></div></script><script type="text/ng-template" id="contents.html"><h1>Help Topics</h1><h3><a ui-sref="help.user">User manual</a></h3><h3><a ui-sref="help.programmer">Programmer's guide</a></h3><h3><a href="doc/index.html" target="_system">API Documentation for the niViz library</a></h3></script><script type="text/ng-template" id="help-user.html"><h2>User Manual</h2><h5><a ui-sref="help.contents">Return to table of contents</a><br><br></h5><h3>1. Starting niViz</h3><h5>When you go to <a target="_blank" href="https://niviz.org">niViz.org</a> in your web browser, you come to a welcome screen that contains links to example data sets, to information relevant to niViz (such as its licence or the standards it is based on), where to submit issues if something does not work as expected and a menu to start using niViz with your own data.</h5><a href="#" ng-click="imgpop('img/welcome.png', 'Welcome screen');"><img class="hoverable" src="img/welcome.png" style="width: 60%;"></a><h3>2. Visualizing an existing profile</h3><h5>After clicking on "Open" in the general menu and selecting your<a href="http://caaml.org/Schemas/SnowProfileIACS/v6.0.3" target="_blank"> CAAML</a> profile, you will be presented with a view of your profile that shows its metadata (several fields are clickable), the profile structure as well as some layers' properties. On the top right corner, you can click on the "burger" menu in order to get more options.</h5><a href="#" ng-click="imgpop('img/visualization1.png', 'Profile visualization');"><img class="hoverable" src="img/visualization1.png" style="width: 60%;"></a><h5>In this "burger" menu, you can choose various visualization options, you can start the profile editor, print the profile or export it to various formats.</h5><a href="#" ng-click="imgpop('img/visualization2.png', 'Visualization burger menu');"><img class="hoverable" src="img/visualization2.png" style="width: 60%;"></a><h5>Back on the profile view, it is possible to zoom into the profile as well as loop through the various parameters that can be shown by clicking on the parameter
 name on the bottom of the profile.</h5><a href="#" ng-click="imgpop('img/visualization3.png', 'Visualization zoom');"><img class="hoverable" src="img/visualization3.png" style="width: 60%;"></a><a href="#" ng-click="imgpop('img/visualization4.png', 'Looping through parameters');"><img class="hoverable" src="img/visualization4.png" style="width: 60%;"></a><h3>3. Visualization customization</h3><h5>When going into niViz's settings (File->Settings), it is possible to configure additional parameters that should be overlayed on the profile view, for each
 profile type. First, select the profile type (for example, "simple"), and then
 add an additional parameter (and define its minimum and maximum values to be
 represented) as well as its color and drawing type.</h5><a href="#" ng-click="imgpop('img/configure_new_param1.png', 'Visualization customization');"><img class="hoverable" src="img/configure_new_param1.png" style="width: 60%;"></a><a href="#" ng-click="imgpop('img/configure_new_param2.png', 'Adding a parameter');"><img class="hoverable" src="img/configure_new_param2.png" style="width: 60%;"></a><h5>You can also choose which properties should be visible in the tabular view that is usually shown on the right side of the profile.</h5><a href="#" ng-click="imgpop('img/configure_new_param3.png', 'Configuring the tabular view');"><img class="hoverable" src="img/configure_new_param3.png" style="width: 40%;"></a><h3>Creating  a new profile</h3><h5>When selecting <b>"Create new profile"</b> in the general menu, a modal window appears that contains buttons for each possible category of data that could be stored in a profile.
 Although this should help guide the user into filling the data into his profile, it is
 possible to start anywhere and to only provide what the user has.</h5><a href="#" ng-click="imgpop('img/create_profile1.png', 'Profile creation guide');"><img class="hoverable" src="img/create_profile1.png" style="width: 50%;"></a><h5>The same dialogues are also available when editing an existing profile. This could be achieved through the "edit" entry in the "burger" menu, but also simply by double-clicking
 on a layer in the profile visualization.</h5><a href="#" ng-click="imgpop('img/edit_profile1.png', 'Profile edition');"><img class="hoverable" src="img/edit_profile1.png" style="width: 50%;"></a><a href="#" ng-click="imgpop('img/edit_profile2.png', 'Profile edition');"><img class="hoverable" src="img/edit_profile2.png" style="width: 70%;"></a><h5>The same content as the modal window for creating a profile is also available in the dock to provide any additional data.</h5><a href="#" ng-click="imgpop('img/edit_profile3.png', 'Profile edition in the dock');"><img class="hoverable" src="img/edit_profile1.png" style="width: 50%;"></a><a href="#" ng-click="imgpop('img/edit_profile4.png', 'Profile edition in the dock');"><img class="hoverable" src="img/edit_profile2.png" style="width: 70%;"></a><h3>Reporting issues</h3><h5>When something does not behave as planed, it is possible (and recommended!) to report it. Please include all information that could help the developers figure out what happened
 and how you were expecting niViz to behave! The issues are submitted through the software
 forge of the project, where you might have to create an account before you can submit an issue.
 Once you are logged in, you can view all the previously created issues as well as submit a new
 issue. Please make sure first that the issue you are about to report has not already been
 reported (it is always possible to comment on an existing issue if needed)!</h5><a href="#" ng-click="imgpop('img/create_issue1.png', 'Looking at issues');"><img class="hoverable" src="img/create_issue1.png" style="width: 60%;"></a><a href="#" ng-click="imgpop('img/create_issue2.png', 'Creating a new issue');"><img class="hoverable" src="img/create_issue2.png" style="width: 60%;"></a></script><script type="text/ng-template" id="help-programmer.html"><h2>Programmer's Guide</h2><h5><a ui-sref="help.contents">Return to table of contents</a><br><br></h5><h5>niViz consists of two separate components<p><ol><li>A visualization library based on&nbsp;<a href="http://snapsvg.io/">Snap.svg</a>, capable of visualizing snow profiles, time series of snow profiles and meteorological forcing data.<br>&nbsp;</li><li>The UI you are currently viewing, which provides a comfortable user interface to visualize snow profiles, timeseries and forcing data by utilizing the niViz visualization library.</li></ol></p></h5><br><br><h3>Embedding a graph in your site</h3><h5><br><p>First make sure to use the newest niViz library in your page</p><pre class="prettyprint"><code>&lt;script type="text/javascript" src="https://niviz.org/lib/niviz-bundle-latest.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</code></pre><p>&nbsp;</p><p>In the following snippet we'll create a web page that contains an<code>&lt;svg id="canvas"&gt;</code>&nbsp;element and we'll add a bit of javascript code to download a CAAML profile from our repository.
Once the file has been read we'll hand it over to the niViz library, which will then parse the file
and visualize the profile in our<code>svg#canvas</code>. Note that we load the script called<code>nivis-bundle-latest.js</code> which is comprised of the niviz core library, the snap.svg.js library and the momentjs library.
These two libraries are the only dependencies the niviz library has. You may of course load them separately
in which case you only need to load the<code>nivis-latest.js</code> library.</p><pre class="prettyprint linenums"><code class="language-html">&lt;html&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
  &lt;meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html;charset=utf-8" /&gt;
  &lt;script type="text/javascript" src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.2.1.min.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
  &lt;script type="text/javascript" src="https://niviz.org/lib/niviz-bundle-latest.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&nbsp;
&lt;script&gt;
function draw () {
 $.ajax({
   url: "https://niviz.org/resources/example.caaml",
   crossDomain: true,
   contentType: 'text/plain',
   success: function (response){
     niviz.parse(response, 'caaml', function (error, station) {
       if  (error) {
         alert('Error while parsing ');
       } else {
           niviz.draw('SimpleProfile', station, $('#canvas'), { miniature: true });
       }
     });
   }
 });
}
&lt;/script&gt;
&nbsp;
&lt;body onload="draw()"&gt;
  &lt;svg id="canvas" style="width: 500px; height: 400px;"&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;</code></pre></h5><script src="https://rawgit.com/google/code-prettify/master/loader/run_prettify.js?autoload=true&amp;amp;skin=sunburst&amp;amp;lang=css"></script><script type="text/ng-template" id="settings.html"><div class="modal-header"><h3 class="modal-title">{{ 'Settings' | t : lang }}</h3></div><form class="form-horizontal" name="modalForm"><div class="modal-body"><uib-tabset><uib-tab ng-repeat="config in modules" heading="{{config.name}}" deselect="tabdeselect(config.name)"><form name="{{config.id}}"><div ng-repeat="setting in config.settings.order" setting="setting" config="config"></div></form></uib-tab></uib-tabset></div><div class="modal-footer settings"><div class="btn-group"><button class="btn btn-default" type="button" ng-click="import()">{{ 'Import' | t : lang }}</button><button class="btn btn-default" type="button" ng-click="export()">{{ 'Export' | t : lang }}</button><button class="btn btn-default" type="button" ng-click="reset()">{{ 'reset_settings' | t : lang }}</button></div><button class="btn btn-default" type="button" ng-click="cancel()">{{ 'Cancel' | t : lang }}</button><button class="btn btn-primary" type="button" ng-click="save()" ng-disabled="modalForm.$invalid">{{ 'Save' | t : lang }}</button></div></form></script><script type="text/ng-template" id="setting.html"><setting-input ng-if="element === 'input'"></setting-input><setting-checkbox ng-if="element === 'checkbox'"></setting-checkbox><setting-select ng-if="element === 'select'"></setting-select><setting-select2 ng-if="element === 'select2'"></setting-select2><setting-colorpicker ng-if="element === 'colorpicker'"></setting-colorpicker><setting-meteo ng-if="element === 'meteo'"></setting-meteo><setting-meteogroup ng-if="element === 'meteogroup'"></setting-meteogroup><setting-pro ng-if="element === 'pro'"></setting-pro><setting-barparams ng-if="element === 'barparams'"></setting-barparams><setting-timelineparams ng-if="element === 'timelineparams'"></setting-timelineparams></script><script type="text/ng-template" id="setting-input.html"><div class="form-group form-group-sm"><label class="control-label col-sm-3" for="{{id}}">{{ setting.name | t : lang}}</label><div class="col-sm-9"><input class="form-control" id="{{id}}" type="{{type}}" ng-model="value" ng-change="setting.set(value)" ng-required="setting.required"><div class="help-block" ng-if="setting.hint">{{ setting.hint | t : lang }}</div></div></div></script><script type="text/ng-template" id="setting-checkbox.html"><div class="form-group form-group-sm"><div class="col-sm-3"></div><div class="checkbox col-sm-9"><label class="checkbox-lbl"><input id="{{id}}" type="checkbox" ng-model="value" ng-change="setting.set(value)" placeholder="{{setting.default}}"><div class="checkbox-lbl-text">{{ setting.name | t : lang }}</div></label><div class="help-block" ng-if="setting.hint">{{ setting.hint | t : lang }}</div></div></div></script><script type="text/ng-template" id="setting-select.html"><div class="form-group form-group-sm"><label class="control-label col-sm-3" for="{{id}}">{{ setting.name | t : lang }}</label><div class="col-sm-9"><select class="form-control" id="{{id}}" ng-model="value" ng-change="setting.set(value)" ng-options="option | t for option in setting.values"></select><div class="help-block" ng-if="setting.hint">{{ setting.hint | t : lang }}</div></div></div></script><script type="text/ng-template" id="setting-select2.html"><div class="form-group form-group-sm"><label class="control-label col-sm-3" for="{{id}}">{{ setting.name | t : lang }}</label><div class="col-sm-9"><ui-select class="form-control" ng-model="value" multiple on-select="setting.set(value)" on-remove="setting.set(value)"><ui-select-match>{{$item.name}}</ui-select-match><ui-select-choices repeat="item in (setting.values | filter: $select.search) track by item.id"><span ng-bind="item.display || item.name"></span></ui-select-choices></ui-select><div class="help-block" ng-if="setting.hint">{{ setting.hint | t : lang}}</div></div></div></script><script type="text/ng-template" id="setting-colorpicker.html"><div class="form-group form-group-sm"><label class="control-label col-sm-3" for="{{id}}">{{ setting.name | t : lang }}</label><div class="col-sm-9"><div class="input-group"><input class="form-control" id="{{id}}" type="{{type}}" ng-model="value" ng-change="setting.set(value)" placeholder="{{setting.default}}" ng-required="setting.required"><span class="input-group-addon colorpicker"><span colorpicker colorpicker-parent="true" colorpicker-close-on-select colorpicker-position="left" ng-model="value" ng-change="setting.set(value)" ng-style="{ backgroundColor: value }">&nbsp;</span></span></div><div class="help-block" ng-if="setting.hint">{{ setting.hint | t : lang }}</div></div></div></script><script type="text/ng-template" id="setting-meteo.html"><div class="form-group form-group-sm params"><div class="col-sm-12"><label class="control-label">{{ 'conf_meteo_settings' | t : lang }}</label></div><div class="col-sm-12"><label class="control-label">&nbsp;</label></div><div class="row" ng-repeat="param in value"><div class="col-sm-10"><div class="input-group"><input class="form-control" id="{{id}}" type="text" ng-model="param.name" ng-change="setting.set(value)" placeholder="Param" required ng-trim="true"><input class="name form-control" id="{{id}}" type="text" ng-model="param.display" ng-change="setting.set(value)" placeholder="Display name" required ng-trim="true"><input class="form-control" id="{{id}}" type="text" ng-model="param.unit" ng-change="setting.set(value)" placeholder="UNIT"><input class="form-control" id="{{id}}" type="text" ng-model="param.min" ng-change="setting.set(value)" placeholder="MIN"><input class="form-control" id="{{id}}" type="text" ng-model="param.max" ng-change="setting.set(value)" placeholder="MAX"><span class="input-group-addon colorpicker"><span colorpicker colorpicker-parent="true" colorpicker-close-on-select colorpicker-position="top" ng-model="param.color" ng-change="setting.set(value)" ng-style="{ backgroundColor: param.color }">&nbsp;</span></span><select class="form-control" id="{{id}}" ng-model="param.convert" ng-change="setting.set(value)" data-placement="bottom" title="Conversion function" ng-options="option for option in setting.values"></select></div></div><div class="col-sm-2"><button class="btn btn-default" type="button" ng-class="{'active': param.log, 'btn-success': param.log, 'btn-default': !param.log}" data-toggle="button" aria-pressed="{{param.log}}" ng-click="param.log = !param.log; setting.set(value)" data-placement="bottom" title="Logarithmic display On/Off"><span>log</span></button><button class="btn btn-default" type="button" ng-click="value.splice($index, 1)" data-placement="bottom" title="Remove parameter config"><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-trash"></span></button></div></div><div class="col-sm-12"><button class="add btn btn-default" type="button" data-placement="right" title="Add another parameter" ng-click="add(value);"><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-plus"></span></button></div></div></script><script type="text/ng-template" id="setting-meteogroup.html"><div class="form-group form-group-sm params"><div class="col-sm-12"><label class="control-label">{{ 'meteo_groups' | t : lang }}</label></div><div class="col-sm-12"><label class="control-label">&nbsp;</label></div><div class="row" ng-repeat="param in value"><div class="col-sm-10"><div class="input-group"><input class="form-control" id="{{id}}" type="text" ng-model="param.name" ng-change="setting.set(value)" placeholder="Group" required ng-trim="true"><input class="name form-control" id="{{id}}" type="text" ng-model="param.display" ng-change="setting.set(value)" placeholder="Display name" required ng-trim="true"><input class="form-control" id="{{id}}" type="text" ng-model="param.unit" ng-change="setting.set(value)" placeholder="UNIT" required ng-trim="true"><input class="form-control" id="{{id}}" type="text" ng-model="param.min" ng-change="setting.set(value)" placeholder="MIN" required ng-trim="true"><input class="form-control" id="{{id}}" type="text" ng-model="param.max" ng-change="setting.set(value)" placeholder="MAX" required ng-trim="true"><input class="group form-control" id="{{id}}" type="text" ng-model="param.group" ng-change="setting.set(value)" placeholder="CSV e.g. ts,tss" required ng-trim="true"></div></div><div class="col-sm-2"><button class="btn btn-default" type="button" ng-class="{'active': param.log, 'btn-success': param.log, 'btn-default': !param.log}" data-toggle="button" aria-pressed="{{param.log}}" ng-click="param.log = !param.log; setting.set(value)" data-placement="bottom" title="{{ 'log_on_off' | t : lang }}"><span>log</span></button><button class="btn btn-default" type="button" ng-click="value.splice($index, 1)" data-placement="bottom" title="{{ 'rm_parameter_config' | t : lang }}"><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-trash"></span></button></div></div><div class="col-sm-12"><button class="add btn btn-default" type="button" data-placement="right" title="{{ 'add_another_parameter' | t : lang }}" ng-click="add(value);"><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-plus"></span></button></div></div></script><script type="text/ng-template" id="setting-pro.html"><div class="form-group form-group-sm pro"><div class="col-sm-12"><label class="control-label">{{ 'conf_pro' | t : lang }}</label></div><div class="col-sm-5"><select class="form-control" id="version" ng-model="version"><option ng-repeat="option in value" value="{{$index}}">{{option.name}}</option></select></div><div class="row" ng-repeat="param in value[version].codes"><div class="col-sm-8"><div class="input-group"><input class="key form-control" id="{{id}}" type="text" ng-model="param.code" required ng-trim="true" ng-change="setting.set(value)" placeholder="{{ 'pro_code' | t : lang }}" ng-readonly="!param.editable"><input class="name form-control" id="{{id}}" type="text" ng-model="param.name" required ng-trim="true" ng-change="setting.set(value)" placeholder="{{ 'pro_name' | t : lang }}" ng-readonly="!param.editable"><input class="display form-control" id="{{id}}" type="text" ng-model="param.display" ng-trim="true" ng-change="setting.set(value)" placeholder="{{ 'pro_display_name' | t : lang }}" ng-readonly="!param.editable"><input class="unit form-control" id="{{id}}" type="text" ng-model="param.unit" ng-trim="true" ng-change="setting.set(value)" placeholder="{{ 'pro_unit' | t : lang }}" ng-readonly="!param.editable"></div></div><div class="col-sm-1"><button class="btn btn-default" type="button" ng-click="remove($index, value[version].codes)" data-placement="bottom" title="{{ 'rm_parameter_config' | t : lang }}" ng-show="param.editable"><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-trash"></span></button></div></div><div class="col-sm-12"><button class="add btn btn-default" type="button" data-placement="right" title="{{ 'add_another_parameter' | t : lang }}" ng-click="add(value[version].codes);"><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-plus"></span></button></div></div></script><script type="text/ng-template" id="setting-barparams.html"><div class="form-group form-group-sm barparams"><div class="col-sm-12"><label class="control-label">{{ 'conf_additional' | t : lang }}</label></div><div class="row" ng-repeat="param in value"><div class="col-sm-10"><div class="input-group"><select class="name form-control" id="{{id}}" ng-model="param.name" ng-focus="update();" ng-change="setting.set(value)" data-placement="bottom" title="Parameter name" ng-options="option for option in types" required></select><input class="form-control" id="{{id}}" type="number" ng-model="param.left" ng-change="setting.set(value)" placeholder="left" required ng-trim="true"><input class="form-control" id="{{id}}" type="number" ng-model="param.right" ng-change="setting.set(value)" placeholder="right" required ng-trim="true"><input class="color form-control" id="{{id}}" type="{{type}}" ng-model="param.color" ng-change="setting.set(value)" placeholder="#000000" required ng-trim="true"><span class="input-group-addon colorpicker"><span colorpicker colorpicker-parent="true" colorpicker-close-on-select colorpicker-position="top" ng-model="param.color" ng-change="setting.set(value)" ng-style="{ backgroundColor: param.color }">&nbsp;</span></span><select class="form-control" id="{{id}}" ng-model="param.style" ng-change="setting.set(value)" data-placement="bottom" title="{{ 'display_style' | t : lang }}" ng-options="option for option in setting.values"></select></div></div><div class="col-sm-2 pull-right"><button class="btn btn-default" type="button" ng-class="{'active': param.log, 'btn-success': param.log, 'btn-default': !param.log}" data-toggle="button" aria-pressed="{{param.log}}" ng-click="param.log = !param.log; setting.set(value)" data-placement="bottom" title="Logarithmic display On/Off"><span>log</span></button><button class="btn btn-default" type="button" ng-click="value.splice($index, 1)" data-placement="bottom" title="{{ 'rm_parameter_config' | t : lang }}"><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-trash"></span></button></div></div><div class="col-sm-12"><button class="add btn btn-default" type="button" data-placement="right" title="{{ 'add_another_parameter' | t : lang }}" ng-click="add(value);"><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-plus"></span></button></div></div></script><script type="text/ng-template" id="setting-timelineparams.html"><div class="form-group form-group-sm timelineparams"><div class="col-sm-12"><label class="control-label">{{ 'add_rm_timeline_parameters' | t : lang }}</label></div><div class="col-sm-12"><label class="smaller parameter">{{ 'tl_params_param' | t : lang }}</label><label class="smaller min">{{ 'tl_params_min' | t : lang }}</label><label class="smaller min">{{ 'tl_params_max' | t : lang }}</label><label class="smaller min">{{ 'tl_params_steps' | t : lang }}</label><label class="smaller gradient">{{ 'tl_params_gradient' | t : lang }}</label></div><div class="row" ng-repeat="param in value" ng-if="!param.hide"><div class="col-sm-10"><div class="input-group"><select class="name form-control" id="{{id}}" ng-model="param.name" ng-focus="update();" ng-change="setting.set(value)" data-placement="bottom" title="{{ 'tl_param_name' | t : lang }}" ng-options="option for option in types" ng-disabled="!param.editable" required></select><input class="form-control" id="{{id}}" type="number" ng-model="param.min" ng-change="setting.set(value)" placeholder="min" required ng-trim="true"><input class="form-control" id="{{id}}" type="number" ng-model="param.max" ng-change="setting.set(value)" placeholder="max" required ng-trim="true"><input class="form-control" id="{{id}}" type="number" ng-model="param.steps" min="2" max="20" ng-change="setting.set(value)" placeholder="steps" required ng-trim="true"><select class="form-control" id="{{id}}" ng-model="param.palette" ng-change="setting.set(value)" data-placement="bottom" title="Gradient Style" ng-options="option for option in setting.values" ng-disabled="!param.editable"></select></div></div><div class="col-sm-2 pull-right" ng-if="param.editable"><button class="btn btn-default" type="button" ng-click="value.splice($index, 1)" data-placement="bottom" title="{{ 'rm_parameter_config' | t : lang }}"><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-trash"></span></button></div></div><div class="col-sm-12"><button class="add btn btn-default" type="button" data-placement="right" title="{{ 'add_another_parameter' | t : lang }}" ng-click="add(value);"><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-plus"></span></button></div></div></script><script type="text/ng-template" id="create.html"><div class="modal-header"><h3 class="modal-title">{{ (header || '_newprofile') | t : lang }}</h3></div><form class="form-horizontal editor-modal" name="modalForm"><div class="modal-body editor"><div ng-if="active === 1"><button class="btn btn-success clickable" ng-click="goto(2)"><div class="row profile-row"><div class="col-xs-1"><div class="profile-icon glyphicon glyphicon-info-sign"></div></div><div class="col-xs-4 profile-name"><span class="pull-left">Metadata</span></div><div class="col-xs-5"><span class="pull-left" ng-if="!checkmeta()">{{ '_pc_meta' | t : lang}}</span><span class="pull-left" ng-if="checkmeta()">{{ checkmeta() }} {{ '_pc_info' | t : lang}}</span></div><div class="col-xs-2"><span class="pull-right"><div class="profile-chevron glyphicon glyphicon-chevron-right"></div></span></div></div></button><button class="btn btn-warning clickable" ng-click="goto(3)"><div class="row profile-row"><div class="col-xs-1"><div class="profile-icon glyphicon glyphicon-align-right"></div></div><div class="col-xs-4 profile-name"><span class="pull-left">Stratigraphy</span></div><div class="col-xs-5"><span class="pull-left" ng-if="!profile.grainshape">{{ '_pc_strat' | t : lang}}</span><span class="pull-left" ng-if="profile.grainshape">{{profile.grainshape.layers.length}} {{ '_pc_layers' | t : lang}}</span></div><div class="col-xs-2"><span class="pull-right"><div class="profile-chevron glyphicon glyphicon-chevron-right"></div></span></div></div></button><button class="btn btn-danger clickable" ng-click="goto(4)"><div class="row profile-row"><div class="col-xs-1"><div class="profile-icon glyphicon glyphicon-scale"></div></div><div class="col-xs-4 profile-name"><span class="pull-left">Temperature</span></div><div class="col-xs-5"><span class="pull-left" ng-if="!profile.temperature">{{ '_pc_temp' | t : lang}}</span><span class="pull-left" ng-if="profile.temperature">{{profile.temperature.layers.length}} {{ '_pc_layers' | t : lang}}</span></div><div class="col-xs-2"><span class="pull-right"><div class="profile-chevron glyphicon glyphicon-chevron-right"></div></span></div></div></button><button class="btn btn-info clickable" ng-click="goto(5)"><div class="row profile-row"><div class="col-xs-1"><div class="profile-icon glyphicon glyphicon-tint"></div></div><div class="col-xs-4 profile-name"><span class="pull-left">LWC</span></div><div class="col-xs-5"><span class="pull-left" ng-if="!profile.wetness || profile.wetness.length &lt;= 1">{{ '_pc_lwc' | t : lang}}</span><span class="pull-left" ng-if="profile.wetness.length &gt; 1">{{profile.wetness.length - 1}} {{ '_pc_profiles' | t : lang}}</span></div><div class="col-xs-2"><span class="pull-right"><div class="profile-chevron glyphicon glyphicon-chevron-right"></div></span></div></div></button><button class="btn btn-default clickable" ng-click="goto(6)"><div class="row profile-row"><div class="col-xs-1"><div class="profile-icon glyphicon glyphicon-resize-small"></div></div><div class="col-xs-4 profile-name"><span class="pull-left">Density</span></div><div class="col-xs-5"><span class="pull-left" ng-if="!profile.density">{{ '_pc_density' | t : lang}}</span><span class="pull-left" ng-if="profile.density">{{profile.density.length}} {{ '_pc_profiles' | t : lang}}</span></div><div class="col-xs-2"><span class="pull-right"><div class="profile-chevron glyphicon glyphicon-chevron-right"></div></span></div></div></button><button class="btn btn-stability clickable" ng-click="goto(7)"><div class="row profile-row"><div class="col-xs-1"><div class="profile-icon glyphicon glyphicon-alert"></div></div><div class="col-xs-4 profile-name"><span class="pull-left">Stability</span></div><div class="col-xs-5"><span class="pull-left" ng-if="!checkstb()">{{ '_pc_stability' | t : lang}}</span><span class="pull-left" ng-if="checkstb()">{{ checkstb() }} {{ '_pc_tests' | t : lang}}</span></div><div class="col-xs-2"><span class="pull-right"><div class="profile-chevron glyphicon glyphicon-chevron-right"></div></span></div></div></button><button class="btn btn-primary clickable" ng-click="goto(8)"><div class="row profile-row"><div class="col-xs-1"><div class="profile-icon glyphicon glyphicon-hand-left"></div></div><div class="col-xs-4 profile-name"><span class="pull-left">Hardness</span></div><div class="col-xs-5"><span class="pull-left" ng-if="!profile.ramm">{{ '_pc_hardness' | t : lang}}</span><span class="pull-left" ng-if="profile.ramm">{{ profile.ramm.length }} {{ '_pc_profiles' | t : lang}}</span></div><div class="col-xs-2"><span class="pull-right"><div class="profile-chevron glyphicon glyphicon-chevron-right"></div></span></div></div></button><button class="btn btn-ssa clickable" ng-click="goto(9)"><div class="row profile-row"><div class="col-xs-1"><div class="profile-icon glyphicon glyphicon-fullscreen"></div></div><div class="col-xs-4 profile-name"><span class="pull-left">SSA</span></div><div class="col-xs-5"><span class="pull-left" ng-if="!profile.ssa">{{ '_pc_ssa' | t : lang}}</span><span class="pull-left" ng-if="profile.ssa">{{ profile.ssa.length }} {{ '_pc_profiles' | t : lang}}</span></div><div class="col-xs-2"><span class="pull-right"><div class="profile-chevron glyphicon glyphicon-chevron-right"></div></span></div></div></button></div><div ng-if="active === 2"><edit-metadata profile="profile" station="station" control="control"></edit-metadata></div><div ng-if="active === 3"><edit-stratprofile class="multiprofile" station="station" profile="profile" callback="repaint" collapsible="false"></edit-stratprofile></div><div ng-if="active === 4"><edit-tempprofile class="multiprofile" collapsible="false" profile="profile" station="station" callback="repaint" varname="'temperature'"></edit-tempprofile></div><div ng-if="active === 5"><edit-lwcprofile class="multiprofile" collapsible="false" profile="profile" station="station" callback="repaint" varname="'lwc'"></edit-lwcprofile></div><div ng-if="active === 6"><edit-densityprofile class="multiprofile" collapsible="false" profile="profile" station="station" callback="repaint" varname="'density'"></edit-densityprofile></div><div ng-if="active === 7"><edit-stbprofiles collapsible="false" profile="profile" station="station" callback="repaint"></edit-stbprofiles></div><div ng-if="active === 8"><edit-hardnessprofiles collapsible="false" profile="profile" station="station" callback="repaint"></edit-hardnessprofiles></div><div ng-if="active === 9"><edit-ssaprofile class="multiprofile" collapsible="false" profile="profile" station="station" callback="repaint" varname="'ssa'"></edit-ssaprofile></div></div><div class="modal-footer settings"><button class="btn btn-default" type="button" ng-if="active === 1 &amp;&amp; !header" ng-click="cancel()">{{ 'Cancel' | t : lang }}</button><button class="btn btn-primary" type="button" ng-if="active === 0" ng-click="goto(1)" ng-disabled="modalForm.$invalid">{{ 'Next' | t : lang }}</button><button class="btn btn-primary" type="button" ng-if="active &gt; 1" ng-click="goto(1)">{{ 'Back' | t : lang }}</button><button class="btn btn-primary" type="button" ng-if="active === 1" ng-click="save()" ng-disabled="modalForm.$invalid">{{ header ? 'Done' : 'Draw' | t : lang }}</button></div></form></script><script type="text/ng-template" id="timeline-modal-height.html"><div class="modal-header"><h3 class="modal-title">Timeline {{ 'snow_height' | t : lang }}</h3></div><form class="form-horizontal" name="modalForm"><div class="modal-body"><div class="form-group form-group-sm"><label class="control-label col-sm-2" for="min">Min (cm)</label><div class="col-sm-3"><input class="form-control" id="min" type="number" ng-model="minvalue" placeholder="AUTO"></div><label class="control-label col-sm-2" for="min">Max (cm)</label><div class="col-sm-3"><input class="form-control" id="max" type="number" ng-model="maxvalue" placeholder="AUTO"></div></div></div><div class="modal-footer settings"><button class="btn btn-default" type="button" ng-click="cancel()">{{ 'Cancel' | t : lang }}</button><button class="btn btn-primary" type="button" ng-click="save()" ng-disabled="modalForm.$invalid">{{ 'Apply' | t : lang }}</button></div></form></script><script type="text/ng-template" id="timeline-modal-extract.html"><div class="modal-header"><h3 class="modal-title">{{ 'extract_time_series' | t : lang }}</h3></div><form class="form-horizontal" name="modalForm"><div class="modal-body modal-extract"><div class="form-group form-group-sm"><div class="col-sm-3"><select class="form-control" id="param" ng-model="data.parameter" required ng-options="option.name for option in parameters"></select></div><label class="col-sm-1">@</label><div class="col-sm-2"><input class="form-control" id="height" type="number" ng-model="data.height" placeholder="cm" required></div><label class="col-sm-1">cm</label><div class="col-sm-2"><select class="form-control" id="isdepth" ng-model="data.isdepth" required><option value="0">{{ 'Height' | t : lang }}</option><option value="1">{{ 'Depth' | t : lang }}</option></select></div><div class="col-sm-2"><select class="form-control" id="isdepth" ng-model="data.functor" required><option value="VALUE">VALUE</option></select></div></div></div><div class="modal-footer settings"><button class="btn btn-default" type="button" ng-click="cancel()">{{ 'Cancel' | t : lang }}</button><button class="btn btn-primary" type="button" ng-click="save()" ng-disabled="modalForm.$invalid">{{ 'extract_time_series' | t : lang }}</button></div></form></script><script type="text/ng-template" id="modal-local-files.html"><div class="modal-header"><h3 class="modal-title">{{ '_your_storage' | t : lang }}</h3></div><div class="modal-body modal-extract"><table class="table"><thead><th class="col-xs-1">#</th><th class="col-xs-4">ID</th><th class="col-xs-4">{{ '_last_edited' | t : lang }}</th><th class="col-xs-1">{{ 'Open' | t : lang }}</th><th class="col-xs-1">{{ 'Delete' | t : lang }}</th></thead><tbody><tr ng-repeat="key in keys"><td class="col xs-1">{{$index + 1}}</td><td class="col xs-4">{{files[key].id}}</td><td class="col xs-4">{{dates[key].format('YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm:ss')}}</td><td class="col xs-1" style="text-align: center;"><button class="btn btn-xs btn-info" type="button" ng-click="open(key)"><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-open-file"></span></button></td><td class="col xs-1" style="text-align: center;"><button class="btn btn-xs btn-warning" type="button" ng-click="rm(key)"><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-trash"></span></button></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="modal-footer settings"><button class="btn btn-default" type="button" ng-click="cancel()">{{ 'Cancel' | t : lang }}</button><button class="btn btn-warning" type="button" ng-click="rmAll()">{{ '_delete_all' | t : lang }}</button></div></script><script type="text/ng-template" id="profiler.html"><div class="header"><a class="close" type="button" aria-hidden="true" ng-click="close()" ng-hide="$parent.overlap">&times;</a><ul class="nav navbar-nav pull-right"><li uib-dropdown><a href="#" uib-dropdown-toggle data-toggle="dropdown" role="button" aria-expanded="false">&#9776;</a><ul class="dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-right" role="menu" uib-dropdown-menu><li><a href ng-click="view('SLFProfile')" ng-hide="miniature">SLF profile</a></li><li><a href ng-click="view('StructureProfile')">Structure profile</a></li><li><a href ng-click="view('SimpleProfile')">Simple profile</a></li><li><a href ng-click="view('SimpleProfile', {miniature: true})" ng-hide="miniature">Bare simple profile</a></li><li><a href ng-click="view('MobileProfile')" ng-hide="miniature">Mobile profile</a></li><!--li--><!-- a(href ng-click="view('TabularProfile')") Tabular snow profile--><li class="divider" ng-show="$parent.overlap"></li><li ng-show="$parent.overlap"><a href ng-click="$parent.maximize('profile');" ng-show="!$parent.pmax">{{ 'Maximize' | t : lang }}</a><a href ng-click="$parent.overlap();" ng-show="$parent.pmax">{{ 'overlap_timeline' | t : lang }}</a></li><li class="divider" ng-if="$parent.showeditor"></li><li ng-if="$parent.showeditor"><a href ng-click="$parent.$parent.showeditor(true);">{{ '_editprofile' | t : lang }} ({{ '_pe_dock' | t : lang }})</a></li><li ng-if="$parent.showeditor"><a href ng-click="$parent.$parent.showmodal(true);">{{ '_editprofile' | t : lang}} ({{ '_pe_modal' | t : lang }})</a></li><li class="divider"></li><li><a href ng-click="print()">{{ 'Print' | t : lang}}</a></li><li class="divider"></li><li><a href ng-click="save('SVG')">{{ 'export_svg' | t : lang }}</a></li><li><a href ng-click="save('PNG')">{{ 'export_png' | t : lang }}</a></li><li><a href ng-click="save('CAAML5')">{{ 'export_caaml5' | t : lang }}</a></li><li><a href ng-click="save('CAAML')">{{ 'export_caaml6' | t : lang }}</a></li><li><a href ng-click="save('JSON')">{{ 'export_json' | t : lang }}</a></li></ul></li></ul><h1 class="title-heading">Profile View - {{station.filename}}</h1></div><svg class="body" id="canvas" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; margin: 5px;"></svg></script><script type="text/ng-template" id="edit-metadata.html"><div class="metadata-pane" ng-form="metaforms" ng-submit="savemeta(); metaforms.$setPristine();"><div class="panel panel-default panel-btn-bar"><div class="panel-body"><div class="btn-toolbar pull-right" ng-init="isCollapsed = true"><button class="btn btn-sm btn-default" type="button" ng-click="clonemeta(); metaforms.$setPristine();" ng-disabled="metaforms.$pristine">{{ '_pe_meta_undo_changes' | t : lang }}</button><button class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" type="submit" ng-click="savemeta(metaforms);" ng-disabled="metaforms.$invalid || metaforms.$pristine">{{ '_pe_meta_save' | t : lang }}</button></div></div></div><div class="scrollable-container meta-section" style="overflow-y:auto;"><uib-accordion close-others="true"><div class="panel-default" uib-accordion-group is-open="status.open[0]"><uib-accordion-heading style="width: 100%;"><div class="clickable" ng-click="togglePane($event, 0);"><div style="display:inline-block;"><div class="panel-heading-title">{{ '_pe_meta_location' | t : lang}}</div></div><span class="label label-danger" ng-show="profile &amp;&amp; locform.$invalid">{{ '_pe_error' | t : lang}}</span><span class="label label-warning" ng-show="profile &amp;&amp; !locform.$pristine">{{ '_pe_changed' | t : lang}}</span><i class="pull-right glyphicon" ng-class="{'glyphicon-chevron-down': status.open[0], 'glyphicon-chevron-right': !status.open[0]}"></i></div></uib-accordion-heading><div class="accordion-body"><form class="form-horizontal" role="form" name="locform" ng-submit="savemeta(metaforms);"><div class="form-group form-group-sm row"><label class="col-sm-3 control-label">{{ '_pe_meta_name' | t : lang}}</label><div class="col-sm-9"><input class="form-control" type="text" name="stationname" ng-model="meta.name" placeholder="{{ '_pe_meta_name' | t : lang}}" required></div></div><div class="form-group form-group-sm row"><label class="col-sm-3 control-label">{{ '_pe_meta_description' | t : lang }}</label><div class="col-sm-9"><input class="input-sm form-control" type="text" ng-model="meta.position.description" placeholder="{{ '_pe_meta_description' | t : lang }}"></div></div><div class="form-group form-group-sm row"><label class="col-sm-3 control-label">{{ '_pe_meta_altitude' | t : lang}}</label><div class="col-sm-9"><div class="row"><div class="col-sm-6"><div class="input-group"><input class="input-sm form-control" type="number" ng-model="meta.position.altitude" min="0" max="10000" placeholder="{{ '_pe_meta_altitude' | t : lang}}" step="0.01"><span class="input-group-addon">m</span></div></div><div class="col-sm-6"><button class="col-sm-12 btn btn-sm btn-info" type="button" ng-click="getPosition(locform);" ng-disabled="blockgeo"><span ng-if="!blockgeo">{{ '_pe_meta_get_position' | t : lang }}</span><span ng-hide="!blockgeo"><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-refresh glyphicon-refresh-animate" ng-if="blockgeo"></span><span ng-if="blockgeo">&nbsp; {{'Processing' | t: lang }} ...</span></span></button></div></div></div></div><div class="form-group form-group-sm row"><label class="col-sm-3 control-label">{{ 'Lat / Lon' | t : lang}}</label><div class="col-sm-9"><div class="row"><div class="col-sm-6"><div class="input-group"><input class="input-sm form-control" type="number" ng-model="meta.position.latitude" min="-90" max="90" placeholder="{{ '_pe_meta_latitude' | t : lang}}" step="0.000000000000001"><span class="input-group-addon">°</span></div></div><div class="col-sm-6"><div class="input-group"><input class="input-sm form-control" type="number" ng-model="meta.position.longitude" min="-180" max="180" placeholder="{{ '_pe_meta_longitude' | t : lang}}" step="0.0000000000000001"><span class="input-group-addon">°</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="form-group form-group-sm row"><label class="col-sm-3 control-label">{{ 'UTM' | t : lang}}</label><div class="col-sm-2"><input class="input-sm form-control" type="text" ng-model="meta.position.utm.zone" placeholder="{{ 'Zone' | t : lang}}" disabled></div><div class="col-sm-3"></div><div class="col-sm-7"><div class="row"><div class="col-sm-6" style="padding-left: 0;"><div class="input-group"><input class="input-sm form-control" type="number" ng-model="meta.position.utm.east" placeholder="{{ 'East' | t : lang}}" step="0.000000000000001" disabled><span class="input-group-addon">E</span></div></div><div class="col-sm-6" style="padding-left: 0;"><div class="input-group"><input class="input-sm form-control" type="number" ng-model="meta.position.utm.north" placeholder="{{ 'North' | t : lang}}" step="0.0000000000000001" disabled><span class="input-group-addon">N</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="form-group form-group-sm row" ng-if="imagesrc"><div class="col-sm-3"><div class="btn-group-vertical pull-right"><button class="btn btn-sm btn-default" type="button" ng-click="zoom(1);"><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-plus"></span></button><button class="btn btn-sm btn-default" type="button" ng-click="zoom(-1);"><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-minus"></span></button></div></div><div class="col-sm-9"><img ng-src="{{imagesrc}}" style="width:100%; height: auto;"></div></div><div class="form-group form-group-sm row"><label class="col-sm-3 control-label">{{ '_pe_meta_aspect' | t : lang}}
/
{{ '_pe_meta_azimuth' | t : lang}}</label><div class="col-sm-4"><ui-select ng-model="meta.position.aspect" theme="bootstrap" reset-search-input="true"><ui-select-match placeholder="{{ '_pe_meta_aspect' | t : lang}}" allow-clear="true">{{ $select.selected }}</ui-select-match><ui-select-choices repeat="choice in niviz.Position.directions | filter: $select.search track by $index"><span ng-bind="choice"></span></ui-select-choices></ui-select></div><div class="col-sm-4"><div class="input-group"><input class="input-sm form-control" type="number" ng-model="meta.position.azimuth" min="0" max="360" placeholder="{{ '_pe_meta_azimuth' | t : lang}}" step="0.01"><span class="input-group-addon">°</span></div></div></div><div class="form-group form-group-sm row"><label class="col-sm-3 control-label">{{ '_pe_meta_slope_angle' | t : lang}}</label><div class="col-sm-4"><div class="input-group"><input class="input-sm form-control" type="number" ng-model="meta.position.angle" min="0" max="89.999" placeholder="{{ '_pe_meta_slope_angle' | t : lang}}" step="0.001"><span class="input-group-addon">°</span></div></div></div><div class="row" ng-hide="true"><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit" id="submit" ng-click="savemeta(metaforms);" ng-disabled="metaforms.$invalid || metaforms.$pristine"></button></div></form></div></div><div class="panel-default" uib-accordion-group is-open="status.open[1]"><uib-accordion-heading style="width: 100%;"><div class="clickable" ng-click="togglePane($event, 1);"><div style="display:inline-block;"><div class="panel-heading-title">{{ '_pe_meta_date_observers' | t : lang}}</div></div><span class="label label-danger" ng-show="profile &amp;&amp; mform.$invalid">{{ '_pe_error' | t : lang}}</span><span class="label label-warning" ng-show="profile &amp;&amp; !mform.$pristine">{{ '_pe_changed' | t : lang}}</span><i class="pull-right glyphicon" ng-class="{'glyphicon-chevron-down': status.open[1], 'glyphicon-chevron-right': !status.open[1]}"></i></div></uib-accordion-heading><div class="accordion-body"><form class="form-horizontal" role="form" name="mform" ng-submit="savemeta(metaforms);"><div class="form-group form-group-sm row"><label class="col-sm-3 control-label">{{ '_pe_meta_date' | t : lang }}</label><div class="col-sm-5"><div class="input-group"><input class="form-control" type="text" uib-datepicker-popup="{{format}}" ng-model="status.datepicked" is-open="picker.opened" readonly datepicker-options="dateOptions" ng-required="true" close-text="Close"><span class="input-group-btn"><button class="btn btn-sm btn-default" type="button" ng-click="open($event)"><i class="glyphicon glyphicon-calendar"></i></button></span></div></div><div class="col-sm-3"><div uib-timepicker ng-model="status.timepicked" show-meridian="false" show-spinners="false"></div></div></div><div class="form-group form-group-sm row"><label class="col-sm-3 control-label">{{ '_pe_meta_timezone' | t : lang }}</label><div class="col-sm-5"><ui-select ng-model="status.timezone" reset-search-input="true"><ui-select-match placeholder="{{ '_pe_meta_timezone' | t : lang }}" allow-clear="false">{{ $select.selected.hr }}</ui-select-match><ui-select-choices repeat="choice.min as choice in niviz.Common.timezones | filter: $select.search"><span ng-bind="choice.hr"></span></ui-select-choices></ui-select></div></div><div class="form-group form-group-sm row"><label class="col-sm-3 control-label">{{ '_pe_meta_observer' | t : lang }}</label><div class="col-sm-9"><input class="form-control" type="text" ng-model="pm.observer" placeholder="{{ '_pe_meta_observer' | t : lang }}"></div></div><div class="form-group form-group-sm row"><label class="col-sm-3 control-label">{{ '_pe_meta_operation' | t : lang }}</label><div class="col-sm-9"><input class="form-control" type="text" name="operation" ng-model="pm.operation" placeholder="{{ '_pe_meta_operation' | t : lang }}"></div></div><div class="form-group form-group-sm row"><label class="col-sm-3 control-label">{{ '_pe_comment' | t : lang }}</label><div class="col-sm-9"><textarea class="form-control" ng-model="pm.comment.metadata" placeholder="{{ '_pe_comment' | t : lang }}" rows="3"></textarea></div></div><div class="row" ng-hide="true"><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit" id="submit" ng-click="savemeta(metaforms);" ng-disabled="metaforms.$invalid || metaforms.$pristine"></button></div></form></div></div><div class="panel-default" uib-accordion-group is-open="status.open[2]"><uib-accordion-heading style="width: 100%;"><div class="clickable" ng-click="togglePane($event, 2);"><div style="display:inline-block;"><div class="panel-heading-title">{{ '_pe_meta_weather_conditions' | t : lang }}</div></div><span class="label label-danger" ng-show="profile &amp;&amp; wform.$invalid">{{ '_pe_error' | t : lang}}</span><span class="label label-warning" ng-show="profile &amp;&amp; !wform.$pristine">{{ '_pe_changed' | t : lang}}</span><i class="pull-right glyphicon" ng-class="{'glyphicon-chevron-down': status.open[2], 'glyphicon-chevron-right': !status.open[2]}"></i></div></uib-accordion-heading><div class="accordion-body"><form class="form-horizontal" role="form" name="wform" ng-submit="savemeta(metaforms);"><div class="form-group form-group-sm row"><label class="col-sm-3 control-label">{{ '_pe_meta_weather_ta' | t : lang}}</label><div class="col-sm-4"><div class="input-group"><input class="form-control" type="number" ng-model="pm.ta" step="0.001" min="-60" max="60" placeholder="{{ '_pe_meta_weather_ta' | t : lang}}"><span class="input-group-addon">°C</span></div></div></div><div class="form-group form-group-sm row"><label class="col-sm-3 control-label">{{ '_pe_meta_weather_wind' | t : lang}}</label><div class="col-sm-4"><div class="input-group"><input class="form-control" type="number" ng-model="status.windspeed" ng-change="computeWindSpeed(status.windspeed)" step="0.001" min="0" max="400" placeholder="{{ '_pe_meta_weather_wind' | t : lang}}"><span class="input-group-addon">km/h</span></div></div><div class="col-sm-4"><ui-select ng-model="pm.wind.estimation" theme="bootstrap" reset-search-input="true" ng-change="computeWindSpeed(pm.wind.estimation)"><ui-select-match placeholder="Wind estimate" allow-clear="true">{{ $select.selected.text }}</ui-select-match><ui-select-choices repeat="choice in niviz.Profile.windspeed | filter: $select.search track by $index"><span ng-bind="choice.text"></span></ui-select-choices></ui-select></div></div><div class="form-group form-group-sm row"><label class="col-sm-3 control-label">{{ '_pe_meta_weather_winddir' | t : lang }}</label><div class="col-sm-4"><ui-select ng-model="pm.wind.dir" theme="bootstrap" reset-search-input="true" ng-change="dir_to_angle();"><ui-select-match placeholder="{{ '_pe_meta_weather_winddir' | t : lang }}" allow-clear="true">{{ $select.selected }}</ui-select-match><ui-select-choices repeat="choice in niviz.Position.directions | filter: $select.search track by $index"><span ng-bind="choice"></span></ui-select-choices></ui-select></div><div class="col-sm-4"><div class="input-group"><input class="input-sm form-control" type="number" ng-model="pm.wind.angle" ng-change="angle_to_dir();" min="0" max="360" placeholder="{{ '_pe_meta_weather_windangle' | t : lang }}" step="0.01"><span class="input-group-addon">°</span></div></div></div><div class="form-group form-group-sm row"><label class="col-sm-3 control-label">{{ '_pe_meta_weather_sky' | t : lang }}</label><div class="col-sm-4"><ui-select ng-model="pm.sky" theme="bootstrap" reset-search-input="true" title=""><ui-select-match placeholder="{{ '_pe_meta_weather_sky' | t : lang }}" allow-clear="true">{{ $select.selected }}</ui-select-match><ui-select-choices repeat="choice in niviz.CAAML.skyconditions | filter: $select.search track by $index"><span ng-bind="choice"></span></ui-select-choices></ui-select></div></div><div class="form-group form-group-sm row"><label class="col-sm-3 control-label">{{ '_pe_meta_weather_precipitation' | t : lang }}</label><div class="col-sm-4"><ui-select ng-model="pm.precipitation" theme="bootstrap" reset-search-input="true" title=""><ui-select-match placeholder="Precipitation" allow-clear="true">{{ $select.selected }}</ui-select-match><ui-select-choices repeat="choice in niviz.CAAML.precipiType | filter: $select.search track by $index"><span ng-bind="choice"></span></ui-select-choices></ui-select></div></div><div class="form-group form-group-sm row"><label class="col-sm-3 control-label">{{ '_pe_comment' | t : lang }}</label><div class="col-sm-9"><textarea class="form-control" ng-model="pm.comment.weather" placeholder="{{ '_pe_comment' | t : lang }}" rows="3"></textarea></div></div><div class="row" ng-hide="true"><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit" id="submit" ng-click="savemeta(metaforms);" ng-disabled="metaforms.$invalid || metaforms.$pristine"></button></div></form></div></div><div class="panel-default" uib-accordion-group is-open="status.open[3]"><uib-accordion-heading style="width: 100%;"><div class="clickable" ng-click="togglePane($event, 3);"><div style="display:inline-block;"><div class="panel-heading-title">{{ '_pe_meta_surface_conditions' | t : lang}}</div></div><span class="label label-danger" ng-show="profile &amp;&amp; surfform.$invalid">{{ '_pe_error' | t : lang}}</span><span class="label label-warning" ng-show="profile &amp;&amp; !surfform.$pristine">{{ '_pe_changed' | t : lang}}</span><i class="pull-right glyphicon" ng-class="{'glyphicon-chevron-down': status.open[3], 'glyphicon-chevron-right': !status.open[3]}"></i></div></uib-accordion-heading><div class="accordion-body"><form class="form-horizontal" role="form" name="surfform" ng-submit="savemeta(metaforms);"><div class="form-group form-group-sm row"><label class="col-sm-3 control-label">{{ '_pe_meta_surface_roughness' | t : lang }}</label><div class="col-sm-9"><ui-select ng-model="pm.roughness"><ui-select-match placeholder="{{ '_pe_meta_surface_roughness' | t : lang }}" allow-clear="true"><span style="font-family: snowsymbolsiacs; width: auto;">{{ $select.selected.symbol }}</span>&nbsp;&nbsp; {{ $select.selected.name }}</ui-select-match><ui-select-choices repeat="choice.id as choice in niviz.CAAML.roughness | filter: $select.search"><span ng-bind="choice.symbol" style="font-family: snowsymbolsiacs;"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; {{ choice.name }}</ui-select-choices></ui-select></div></div><div class="form-group form-group-sm row" ng-if="!$parent.$parent.$parent.$parent.$parent.header"><label class="col-sm-3 control-label">{{ '_pe_meta_surface_penetration' | t : lang}}</label><div class="col-sm-3"><div class="input-group"><input class="form-control" type="number" ng-model="pm.penetration.ram" min="0" max="5000" placeholder=" Ram" step="0.00001"><span class="input-group-addon">cm</span></div></div><div class="col-sm-3"><div class="input-group"><input class="form-control" type="number" ng-model="pm.penetration.foot" min="0" max="5000" placeholder="Foot" step="0.00001"><span class="input-group-addon">cm</span></div></div><div class="col-sm-3"><div class="input-group"><input class="form-control" type="number" ng-model="pm.penetration.ski" min="0" max="5000" placeholder="Ski" step="0.00001"><span class="input-group-addon">cm</span></div></div></div><div class="form-group form-group-sm row"><label class="col-sm-3 control-label">{{ '_pe_comment' | t : lang }}</label><div class="col-sm-9"><textarea class="form-control" ng-model="pm.comment.surface" placeholder="{{ '_pe_comment' | t : lang }}" rows="3"></textarea></div></div><div class="row" ng-hide="true"><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit" id="submit" ng-click="savemeta(metaforms);" ng-disabled="metaforms.$invalid || metaforms.$pristine"></button></div></form></div></div><div class="panel-default" uib-accordion-group is-open="status.open[4]"><uib-accordion-heading style="width: 100%;"><div class="clickable" ng-click="togglePane($event, 4);"><div style="display:inline-block;"><div class="panel-heading-title">{{ '_pe_meta_snow_conditions' | t : lang }}</div></div><span class="label label-danger" ng-show="profile &amp;&amp; wform.$invalid">{{ '_pe_error' | t : lang}}</span><span class="label label-warning" ng-show="profile &amp;&amp; !wform.$pristine">{{ '_pe_changed' | t : lang}}</span><i class="pull-right glyphicon" ng-class="{'glyphicon-chevron-down': status.open[4], 'glyphicon-chevron-right': !status.open[4]}"></i></div></uib-accordion-heading><div class="accordion-body"><form class="form-horizontal" role="form" name="wform" ng-submit="savemeta(metaforms);"><div class="form-group form-group-sm row"><label class="col-sm-3 control-label">{{ '_pe_meta_snow_hs' | t : lang }}</label><div class="col-sm-4"><div class="input-group"><input class="form-control" type="number" ng-model="pm.hs" min="0" max="5000" placeholder="{{ '_pe_meta_snow_hs_ph' | t : lang }}" uib-tooltip="{{ '_pe_meta_snow_hs_tt' | t : lang }}" tooltip-placement="bottom" step="0.00001"><span class="input-group-addon">cm</span></div></div></div><div class="form-group form-group-sm row"><label class="col-sm-3 control-label">{{ '_pe_meta_snow_hn24' | t : lang }}</label><div class="col-sm-4"><div class="input-group"><input class="form-control" type="number" ng-model="pm.hn24" min="0" max="5000" placeholder="{{ '_pe_meta_snow_hn24_ph' | t : lang }}" uib-tooltip="{{ '_pe_meta_snow_hn24_tt' | t : lang }}" tooltip-placement="bottom" step="0.00001"><span class="input-group-addon">cm</span></div></div></div><div class="form-group form-group-sm row"><label class="col-sm-3 control-label">{{ '_pe_comment' | t : lang }}</label><div class="col-sm-9"><textarea class="form-control" ng-model="pm.comment.snowpack" placeholder="{{ '_pe_comment' | t : lang }}" rows="3"></textarea></div></div><div class="row" ng-hide="true"><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit" id="submit" ng-click="savemeta(metaforms);" ng-disabled="metaforms.$invalid || metaforms.$pristine"></button></div></form></div></div><div class="panel-default" uib-accordion-group is-